ffice (Word, Excel, Outlook) and phone systems.\n* Ability to multitask and manage time effectively.\n* Attention to detail and strong organizational skills.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Benefits of being a part of the team** \n\n\n\n\n*Family Health Insurance including parents* \n\n\n\n\n*Life \\& Accident Insurance* \n\n\n\n\n*Maternity/paternity leave* \n\n\n\n\n*Performance\\-based incentives* \n\n\n\n\n*Referral Bonus program* \n\n\n\n\n*Exam Fee Reimbursement Policy* \n\n\n\n\n*Indian festival holidays* \n\n\n\n\n*5 days working week* \n\n\n\n\n*Meals facility* \n\n\n\n\n*Doctor's Consultation*"},{"title":"Account Manager","company":"Pintola","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-08-19","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/account-manager-job-in-ahmedabad-at-pintola1787099444","experience":"5 year(s)"},{"title":"Senior Tax Associate","company":"Elevate","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-08-19","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/senior-tax-associate-job-in-ahmedabad-at-elevate1787099444","experience":"3 year(s)"},{"title":"Service Excellence Coordinator","company":"Mayflower Women's Hospital","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-08-19","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-service-excellence-coordinator-job-in-ahmedabad-at-mayflower-womens-hospital1787099438"},{"title":"Project Coordinator With Auto-CAD Knowledge","company":"Loud And Clear","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-08-19","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/project-coordinator-with-auto-cad-knowledge-job-in-ahmedabad-at-loud-and-clear1787099518","experience":"5 year(s)"},{"title":"Senior SMSF Specialist","company":"SourceIN","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-08-19","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/senior-smsf-specialist-job-in-ahmedabad-at-sourcein1787099515","experience":"5 year(s)"},{"title":"Enterprise SMB Account Manager","company":"Jio","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-08-19","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/